@page
@inject Microsoft.Extensions.Options.IOptions<LegalSettings> LegalOptions
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Terms"; }
<div class="page-heading legal-heading"><div class="eyebrow">Terms</div><h1>The ground rules.</h1><p class="muted">Last updated @Legal.Updated</p></div>
<article class="legal">
    <p>@Legal.OperatorDescription By creating an account or using S4 OPS you agree to these terms. Questions go to <partial name="_Contact" model='@("S4 OPS terms")' />.</p>

    <h2>What S4 OPS is</h2>
    <p>S4 OPS is a virtual-airline tool for Microsoft Flight Simulator 2024. It is for simulation and entertainment only. Never use it for real-world flight planning, navigation or operations.</p>
    <p>S4 OPS is an independent project. It is not made by, or affiliated with, Microsoft, Asobo Studio, or any real airline. Flight numbers, callsigns and airline names on the site are fictional unless an airline's own crew chose them.</p>

    <h2>Your account</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Keep your sign-in details to yourself. You're responsible for what happens under your account.</li>
        <li>One person per account. Don't create accounts for others or impersonate anyone.</li>
        <li>You can stop using S4 OPS and <a href="/Account/Delete">delete your account</a> at any time.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Airlines and what you post</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>You own what you add: airline names, logos, schedules and descriptions. You give us permission to store and show it to the people it's meant for, so the service works.</li>
        <li>Only upload logos and images you have the right to use. Don't use real airlines' trademarks in a way that suggests they're involved.</li>
        <li>Airline owners and administrators decide who joins their airline and what roles they have.</li>
        <li>No harassment, hateful content, spam, or attempts to break into accounts or the service. We may remove content or suspend accounts that do.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Early access</h2>
    <p>S4 OPS is in early access. All levels are complimentary for now, and no payment is collected. Features may change, and the service may be unavailable at times. If paid levels are introduced, we'll explain the prices and terms first, and nothing will be charged without your agreement.</p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>S4 OPS is provided "as is", without warranties of any kind. To the extent the law allows, @Legal.Operator is not liable for lost data, lost time or other indirect losses from using it. Keep your own copy of anything important; you can <a href="/Account/Profile#your-data">download your data</a> at any time.</p>

    <h2>Changes and law</h2>
    <p>If these terms change in a way that matters, we'll say so on the site before the change takes effect. These terms are governed by the laws of @LegalOptions.Value.Jurisdiction.</p>
    <p>See also the <a href="/Privacy">privacy page</a>.</p>
</article>
